<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia's STB bank starts bond fund.</title>
<headline>Tunisia's STB bank starts bond fund.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia's Societe Tunisienne de Banque STB on Wednesday announced it has set up an open-ended bond investment fund called SICAV-L'Epargnant.</p>
<p>The fund's initial capital was set at 500,000 dinars. Subscriptions date for private investors will be announced soon, the sources said.</p>
<p>SICAV-L'Epargnant will be Tunisia's eighth open-ended bond investment fund.</p>
<p>($=1.04 dinar)</p>
<p>Tunis newsroom, 216-1-787538</p>
